# PROJ-31: Streaming chat backend (alice-chat-stream).
#
# When this variable is set, the chat UI uses the SSE streaming endpoint
# `${NEXT_PUBLIC_STREAM_API_URL}/stream/chat` and renders tokens live.
# When unset, the chat falls back to the legacy non-streaming endpoint
# `/api/webhook/v1/chat/completions` (alice-chat-handler n8n workflow).
#
# In production this should be a same-origin path that nginx proxies to
# the alice-chat-stream container (PROJ-32). For local dev against the
# container directly, point it at http://localhost:8003.
NEXT_PUBLIC_STREAM_API_URL=/api/stream
